                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">
                                            <span t-esc="o.amount_untaxed"
                                                  t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': currency}"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; text-align: right;">
                                            <b>VAT (5%)</b>
                                        </td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">
                                            <span t-esc="o.amount_tax"
                                                  t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': currency}"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px; text-align: right;">
                                            <b>Grand Total</b>
                                        </td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;"></td>
                                        <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">
                                            <span t-esc="o.amount_total"
                                                  t-options="{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': currency}"/>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>

                                    <tr>
                                        <td colspan="5" style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 6px;">
                                            <b>Amount in Words:</b>
                                            <span t-esc="o.currency_id.amount_to_text(o.amount_total).upper() + ' ' + o.currency_id.name.upper() + ' ONLY'"/>
                                        </td>


                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                            <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">

                                <b style="font-size: 13px;">Assumptions &amp; Considerations</b>

                                <ol style="margin: 8px 0 0 18px; padding: 0;">
                                    <li>We have considered GI tray and trunking for the electrical &amp; data works.
                                    </li>
                                    <li>Ducted type DX AC units will be supplied by the client.</li>
                                    <li>Ducts considered for AC works are PI ducts.</li>
                                    <li>Main electrical source and its cabling shall be arranged by the client.</li>
                                    <li>DB components shall be from Schneider / ABB.</li>
                                    <li>FOH switches and sockets shall be of SS / Chrome finish.</li>
                                    <li>All BOH switches, sockets and isolators shall be from Schneider / Legrand.</li>
                                    <li>MEP provisions are considered only for a normal café. Provision and pricing
                                        shall be revised based on the final kitchen equipment layout and schedules.
                                    </li>
                                </ol>

                            </div>
                            <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;">

                                <b style="text-decoration: underline;">Exclusions:</b>
                                <ol style="margin: 8px 0 0 18px; padding: 0;">
                                    <li>Treated fresh air handling unit.</li>
                                    <li>Kitchen hood design, kitchen hood, kitchen hood ventilation fan and ducting.
                                    </li>
                                    <li>Supply of AC units.</li>
                                    <li>Any civil works and core cutting.</li>
                                    <li>Annual maintenance contract.</li>
                                    <li>Third party inspections, reports and commissioning.</li>
                                    <li>Authority approvals and fees for authority inspections.</li>
                                    <li>Any other services or scope mentioned in the scope description.</li>
                                    <li>Temporary electrical power and water for the works.</li>
                                    <li>Restroom, drinking water and washrooms for the workers.</li>
                                    <li>Lighting control wiring and light control system.</li>
                                    <li>Main electrical cable from NAMA feeder and its installation. If required,
                                        cabling and laying shall be done at a rate of OMR 50/- per metre.
                                    </li>
                                    <li>Any data, WiFi, CCTV, fire alarm and fire fighting related works.</li>
                                </ol>

                                <br/>

                                <b style="text-decoration: underline;">Payment Terms:</b>
                                <ul style="margin: 8px 0 0 18px; padding: 0;">
                                    <li>50% advance.</li>
                                    <li>30% on completion of above ceiling &amp; below floor works.</li>
                                    <li>10% on completion of final fixtures.</li>
                                    <li>10% on completion of testing &amp; commissioning.</li>
                                </ul>

                                <br/>

                                <b style="text-decoration: underline;">Duration Considered:</b>
                                <p style="margin: 6px 0 0 0;">
                                    To be discussed and agreed as per site condition.
                                    <br/>
                                    Quote Validity:
                                    <b>15 Days</b>
                                </p>
                                <br/>
                                <p style="margin-top: 10px; text-align: justify;">
                                    We hope we have correctly interpreted your requirements and that our offer is of
                                    interest.
                                    We once again thank you for inviting us and look forward to receiving your valuable
                                    work order.
                                    In the meantime, should you require further information or discussion, please feel
                                    free to
                                    contact the undersigned.
                                </p>
